<title>USA: Versace family 'committed' to company's future.</title>
<headline>Versace family 'committed' to company's future.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The brother and sister of slain Italian designer Gianni Versace said they are suffering from loss and pain but remain committed to their family business.</p>
<p>&quot;It must be remembered that Gianni Versace stood for the future and so of course we stand dedicated to the future of our company,&quot; said Donatella and Santo Versace in a statement released from Miami.</p>
</text>
